  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "はねを　おりたたみ\nていくう　ひこうで　とつげきする。\nじぶんも　かなり　ダメージを　うける。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "날개를 접어\n저공비행으로 돌격한다.\n자신도 상당한 데미지를 입는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "收起翅膀，\n低空飛行突擊對手。\n自己也會受到不小的傷害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur replie ses ailes et charge en rase-mottes.\nBlesse gravement le lanceur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender greift aus niedriger Höhe an. Er erleidet\nbei dieser Attacke selbst großen Schaden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pliega sus alas y ataca con un vuelo rasante. El Pokémon\nque lo usa también resulta seriamente dañado.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa ripiega le ali e carica da bassa quota.\nTuttavia, subisce considerevoli danni.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user tucks in its wings and charges from a low\naltitude. This also damages the user quite a lot.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "はねを　おりたたみ\n低空飛行で　突撃する。\n自分も　かなり　ダメージを　受ける。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "收拢翅膀，\n通过低空飞行突击对手。\n自己也会受到不小的伤害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pliega sus alas y ataca con un vuelo rasante. El Pokémon\nque lo usa también resulta seriamente dañado.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
